{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_15106770","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"15106770","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1510677001:1":{"text":"나무 상자 안에는 열쇠가 하나 들어있었다. 황동색 광택이 나는 부드러운 촉감으로 보아, 이 또한 탈리가 만든 것이 분명했다.","source_cn":"木匣中躺着一把钥匙。黄铜抛光的温润手感，明显也是出自塔...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x23F8B4980D979491","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"picture:0::2":{"text":"열쇠","source_cn":"钥匙","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1AAC35C9ABEE127","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1510677002:1":{"text":"열쇠는 찾았지만, 이 열쇠로 어떤 문을 열어야 할지는 여전히 의문이 풀리지 않았다.","source_cn":"你已经找到了钥匙，但仍然不知道钥匙应打开哪扇门。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF50A60F580499F88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1510677003:1":{"text":"이제 탈리가 빛의 광원을 숨긴 곳만 찾으면 되겠네요.","source_cn":"接下来，我们只需要找到塔利藏匿光源的地方。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB8665A93854E373F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1510677004:1":{"text":"문제는, 광원이 정확히 어디에 있냐는 거야.","source_cn":"问题来了。光源在哪？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC92359F0AF59F0D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","d